<title>USA: AnnTaylor Stores Dec same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>AnnTaylor Stores Dec same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AnnTaylor Stores Corp said net sales for the five week period ended January 4 were up 12.4 percent to $101,470,000 over last year's $90,247,000, while same-store sales increased 8.8 percent.</p>
<p>For the fiscal year-to-date period, net sales totaled $754,636,000, up 10.9 percent from $680,493,000 a year-ago. Same-store sales increased 1.8 percent for the year-to-date period.</p>
</text>
